00:28:49,411 --> 00:28:55,411
"South Park: Joining the Panderverse" is a 2023 American adult
animated comedy television special episode.

11
00:31:42,352 --> 00:31:48,352
It is the fifth South Park television special, and the
326th episode of the series overall.

12
00:34:35,294 --> 00:34:41,294
The special premiered on October 27, 2023 on Paramount+.

13
00:37:28,235 --> 00:37:34,235
The episode parodies The Walt Disney Company, CEO Robert "Bob" Iger and Lucasfilm President Kathleen Kennedy in particular, and
the perceived practice of producing formulaic films exhibiting "forced wokeness", for reasons of identity politics.

14
00:40:21,176 --> 00:40:27,176
The story depicts fourth-grader Eric Cartman as he is transported to another universe in which all of South Park's residents are racially diverse women opposed to the
patriarchy, while a version of Kennedy that resembles Cartman is depicted frequently tampering with Disney's productions by demanding inclusion of minority groups.

15
00:43:14,117 --> 00:43:20,117
The film explores themes of artificial intelligence (a.i.), satire,
social satire, adult animation, political satire.

16
00:46:07,058 --> 00:46:13,058
The tone is lighthearted and dark and thought_provoking.
